<title>UK: STV confirms sale of HTV stake.</title>
<headline>STV confirms sale of HTV stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scottish Television on Friday confirmed the sale of its 19.99 percent stake in HTV Group Plc to United News &amp; Media Plc for 73.7 million stg.</p>
<p>The sale was first announced on October 25 and was completed when a unit of STV exercised a put option on the 17.55 million shares.</p>
<p>United News has said it regards the stake as an investment and has no plans to make an offer for the rest of HTV's share capital. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
